# Claude settings member-union rules
# Scopes the source behind the ecosystem-worktree member-repo merge (Axis B):
# the leaf [claude] config + Merge (root-wins-gap scalars including
# allowGroveTools, array unions), the seeder (the auto-derived Edit(//<dir>/**)
# rules and the allowGroveTools -> Bash(<tool>:*) expansion), and the per-
# worktree union resolver that drives them. Changes to any of these should
# trigger the claude-settings-member-union E2E scenario, which drives a real
# grove-anthropic sync-settings --all across an ecosystem and asserts the
# unioned arrays, root-wins bool, auto-Edit rules, and grove-tools expansion.
# Paths are relative to the flow repo root.

